 leave a wishlist to help support the game! Small summary of the changes:Updated textures for most of the charactersUpdated UIsUpdated FontUpdated Game EndingNew MusicNew SFXBalance changes Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:31:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4758150-1846651706674899","game_id":"steam-4758150","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated for the Finnish Games Week!","summary":"Hello everyone! Supinaa: Rogue Sapling is part of the Finnish Game Week event! Try out the demo and wishlist the game if you enjoy it! There has been some updates for the game and here is short list of the changes:Status Effects removed end of combatNew upgradesReward balancingDefault resolution is full screen borderless.New icons, SFX and visual effects for abilitiesOwn font for RisuNew UI soundsFitting for the Finnish Games Week, Supinaa: Rogue Sapling was also features in the National Finnish","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:28:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674899","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4758150-1844751498230561","game_id":"steam-4758150","kind":"announcement","title":"Supinaa: Rogue Sapling Release Date Announcement!","summary":"Hello everyone! I have been working hard on the game and preparing for the Steam Next Fest. I created the trailer for the game and you should check it out! Game is set to release on November 16th. I have increased the size of my company and currently I have two employees working on the game and creating art and music. I already reached out for additional contracting for music and translations and hopefully those will be ready for the Steam Next Fest. Please support the game by wishlisting the ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T05:12:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230561","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4758150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4758150":"2026-10-26T14:06:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4758150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:53Z"},"5048970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:54Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4758150","app_id":4758150,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:55Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"15635cab19f0dcb8e453e6bbcaa7511df38d3b85a689a671319719fe60a9b439","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"You are a small sapling and hear voices that guide your every step. Defeat enemies, collect powers and grow over time. Will you carve your own path or become a champion of the Risu?","publishers":[{"name":"Paahtimo Games","creator_clan_account_id":44902514}],"developers":[{"name":"Paahtimo Games","creator_clan_account_id":44902514}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794837600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailer